{
  "uid": "secunitec-trazas",
  "title": "Trazas",
  "description": "R19: trazas gateway → billing → Postgres, service graph y logs correlacionados.",
  "tags": [
    "secunitec",
    "trazas",
    "R19"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "5s",
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Resiliencia del gateway",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/secunitec-resiliencia",
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "title": "USE Overview",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/secunitec-use",
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "title": "Trazas",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/secunitec-trazas",
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Trazas\n**Trazas distribuidas (R19).** Cada petición que entra por el gateway abre una traza nueva (TB0: el gateway ignora el `traceparent` del cliente) que cruza **gateway → billing → Postgres / Mongo**. El atributo `secunitec.correlation_id` enlaza la traza con el evento de auditoría en Mongo. Desde un span se salta a sus logs en Loki."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "nodeGraph",
      "title": "Mapa de servicios (service graph de Tempo)",
      "description": "traces_service_graph_request_total: quién llama a quién, con tasa y errores.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 15,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "serviceMap",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Últimas trazas de Billing",
      "description": "TraceQL: trazas que tocaron Billing. Clic en el trace id para abrir la cascada completa.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 15,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"secunitec-billing\"}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Trazas con consultas a Postgres",
      "description": "TraceQL: {span.db.system.name=\"postgresql\"} (convención de Npgsql 10). Criterio de done de 5.2.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"secunitec-gateway\"} >> {span.db.system.name=\"postgresql\"}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Trazas lentas (más de 500 ms)",
      "description": "TraceQL: {duration > 500ms}. Sirve para ubicar la saturación de Billing durante la etapa 5.3.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{duration > 500ms}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia p95 por operación (span metrics de Tempo)",
      "description": "traces_spanmetrics_latency: p95 de los spans de servidor por servicio.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, service) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "secunitec-gateway"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#2a78d6"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "secunitec-billing"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#eb6834"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "secunitec-identity"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#1baf7a"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max",
            "mean"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs de los servicios (Loki)",
      "description": "Logs de gateway, identity y billing recibidos por OTLP. Cada línea lleva trace_id para saltar a su traza.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "{service_name=~\"secunitec-.+\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "maxLines": 200
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      }
    }
  ]
}
